{
  "_why": [
    "This repository has no Node in its build and QML has no var() to resolve, so it cannot consume",
    "@redrob-labs/ui the way every other Redrob product does. The delivery anticipates that: it ships",
    "dist/styles/tokens.json with every var() chain already resolved per theme, and dist/native/",
    "redrob_tokens.h as 0xAARRGGBB constants, precisely for a surface that cannot evaluate CSS.",
    "",
    "Those two files are vendored here and pinned by sha256. The hash is the gate: a vendored copy that",
    "drifts repaints the whole app in values no other product uses, and nothing in a build would",
    "notice, because a colour literal compiles exactly as well when it is wrong.",
    "",
    "tools/generate_design_tokens.py --check verifies both the pin and that qml/RedrobTokens.qml is",
    "still what the tokens produce."
  ],
  "package": "@redrob-labs/ui",
  "version": "1.0.2",
  "vendored_tokens": [
    {
      "file": "third_party/redrob-ui/tokens.json",
      "delivery_path": "dist/styles/tokens.json",
      "purpose": "every token resolved per theme, for a consumer with no CSS engine",
      "sha256": "12ff082d7319df33be6f4938c241003749b8cd42ed2090c57dc6041e1644ed94"
    },
    {
      "file": "third_party/redrob-ui/redrob_tokens.h",
      "delivery_path": "dist/native/redrob_tokens.h",
      "purpose": "the same colours as 0xAARRGGBB constants, for the C++ host",
      "sha256": "b476827d8420a86ef3e03d98f2f28cfa621ace9c06ddef0645365a2f97199041"
    }
  ],
  "vendored_icons": {
    "_why": [
      "The tool rail draws its glyphs from the design system's icon set, as standalone SVGs from",
      "dist/native/icons/, because QML cannot run the React icon components. Stroke is currentColor;",
      "QML tints each one from a token through the button's icon.color, never by editing the file.",
      "",
      "PROVISIONAL: these come from redrob-labs/ui PR #34 at c583180, which adds the eight canvas",
      "tool glyphs and the native export. Re-copy from the released package and move this pin to",
      "that version once it is published."
    ],
